#: ../docs/source/chain/env.rst:38
msgid ""
"Use M5Stack Basic with UART2 TX=21 and RX=22, as in the existing Chain examples. Connect the "
"module as the first device through the matching Chain interface and observe the serial console. "
"Press BtnA to stop and run the cleanup code after the loop. The example temporarily enables "
"reporting and restores its changed settings after BtnA stops the loop. No settings are saved to "
"flash."
msgstr ""
"使用 M5Stack Basic，UART2 的 TX=21、RX=22，与现有 Chain 示例一致。通过匹配的 Chain 接口将模块接为第一个设备，观察串口输出。按 BtnA "
"停止循环，并执行循环后的清理代码。 示例临时启用事件上报，并在按 BtnA 停止循环后恢复其更改的设置，不保存到 Flash。"

