#: ../docs/source/chain/env.rst:623
msgid ""
"Register one event callback, replacing the previous callback. Registration does not change device"
" reporting settings. The callback receives one integer. Do not call Chain methods inside the "
"callback; record the event for the main loop. The status byte packs temperature in bits 0..1, "
"humidity in 2..3, pressure in 4..5 and altitude in 6..7. Each field: 1 high alarm, 2 low alarm, 3"
" low alarm cleared; 0 can mean unchanged or high alarm cleared. The firmware does not distinguish"
" these two meanings, so use live readings to determine the current state."
msgstr ""
"注册一个事件回调并替换此前的回调，不改变设备上报设置。回调接收一个整数参数。请在回调中记录事件，由主循环处理，不要在回调内调用 Chain 方法。状态字节中温度占位 0..1、湿度占位 "
"2..3、气压占位 4..5、海拔占位 6..7。每个字段：1 超上限、2 低于下限、3 下限告警解除；0 可能表示未变化或上限告警解除。固件无法区分这两种含义，应读取实时数值判断当前状态。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/env.rst:625
msgid "Function called with the event integer; None unregisters it."
msgstr "接收事件整数的函数；None 表示注销回调。"

