msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |m5basic_chain_env_basic_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid ""
"Connect Chain ENV as the first device on M5Stack Basic UART2 (TX=21, RX=22). The screen displays "
"temperature (degrees Celsius), humidity (%), pressure (hPa), and altitude (m), refreshed every "
"500 ms. Set SEA_LEVEL_PRESSURE_PA to the current local sea-level pressure. The initial Shenzhen "
"test reference is 101330 Pa (1013.3 hPa)."
msgstr ""
"将 Chain ENV 接为 M5Stack Basic UART2（TX=21、RX=22）上的第一个设备。屏幕显示温度（°C）、湿度（%）、气压（hPa）和海拔（m），每 500 ms "
"刷新一次。将 SEA_LEVEL_PRESSURE_PA 设置为当前当地海平面气压，默认使用深圳参考值 101330 Pa（1013.3 hPa）。"

msgid "Bases: :py:class:`~chain.key.KeyChain`"
msgstr "基类：:py:class:`~chain.key.KeyChain`"

msgid "Driver for Chain ENV."
msgstr "Chain ENV 驱动。"

msgid "Set SPA06 temperature sampling rate."
msgstr "设置 SPA06 温度采样率。"

msgid "Set SPA06 pressure sampling rate."
msgstr "设置 SPA06 气压采样率。"

msgid "Set the reference pressure for altitude calculation."
msgstr "设置计算海拔时使用的参考气压。"

msgid ""
"Select the enabled alarm sources. Zero disables all alarms. Bits: 1 temperature, 2 humidity, 4 "
"pressure, 8 altitude."
msgstr "选择启用的报警类型。0 关闭全部报警，各位分别为：1 温度、2 湿度、4 气压、8 海拔。"

msgid "Set the temperature alarm window and source."
msgstr "设置温度报警阈值及温度传感器。"

msgid "Set the humidity alarm window."
msgstr "设置湿度报警阈值。"

msgid "Set the pressure alarm window."
msgstr "设置气压报警阈值。"

msgid "Pressure in Pa, resolution 10 Pa. Range: 70000..120000; low must be less than high."
msgstr "气压，单位 Pa，分辨率 10 Pa，范围 70000～120000；低阈值必须小于高阈值。"

msgid "Set the altitude alarm window."
msgstr "设置海拔报警阈值。"

msgid "Detach the device and release its callbacks; the shared bus stays open."
msgstr "注销设备并清除事件回调，保留共享总线。"

msgid "None. Repeated calls are safe."
msgstr "无返回值，可重复调用。"

msgid "Register a high, low, high-clear or low-clear alarm callback."
msgstr "注册高值、低值、高值解除或低值解除报警的回调函数。"

msgid ""
"Use EVENT_<SOURCE>_HIGH, LOW, HIGH_CLEAR or LOW_CLEAR. Each handler receives its selected event "
"constant. Register before enabling alarms. Registration does not change hardware settings. "
"Perform I/O in the loop. HIGH_CLEAR requires only that source enabled via set/get_alarm_mode(); "
"its source cannot be identified with multiple alarms enabled. Legacy source selectors and the "
"single-callback form receive raw status."
msgstr ""
"使用 EVENT_<SOURCE>_HIGH、LOW、HIGH_CLEAR 或 LOW_CLEAR "
"选择事件。回调参数为所选事件常量，请先注册回调，再开启报警。注册回调不会改变硬件设置；设备读写应在主循环中执行。HIGH_CLEAR 需要通过 set/get_alarm_mode() "
"只启用对应的一种报警，同时启用多种报警时无法确定其来源。旧事件来源选择器和单回调形式接收原始状态值。"

msgid "An EVENT_* constant, legacy callback or None. Default None. None clears all handlers."
msgstr "EVENT_* 事件常量、旧形式的回调函数或 None，默认 None。None 注销全部回调。"

msgid "Handler receiving the selected event constant. Default None removes the selected source's handler."
msgstr "接收所选事件常量的回调函数，默认 None。None 注销所选事件的回调。"

msgid "None. Each source's handler can be replaced independently."
msgstr "无返回值，各事件的回调可以单独替换。"
